      "rationale": "Starts no review read while hold is set, which the reviewer passes while the navigation is still settling on a subject, and otherwise starts one read per question key, selection or explicit refresh. Opening the reviewer therefore asks the review once, for the subject the catalogue chose, instead of first reading a default and then re-reading.",
      "role": "enforcement"
    },
